<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The native <dialog> every page popup sits in (Countdown
  Promo Popup, Coupon Promo Popup, Promotion Popup Discount, Promotional
  Newsletter 2, Image Banner Popup, Signup Discount Popup, Promotional
  Popup 2, Spin Wheel Popup). Rendered by those sections only:
  {% render 'page-popup-dialog', sid: section.id %}

  The section keeps its own look: the dialog box itself is invisible and
  never takes the closed state away (display stays block), so the section's
  own fade in and out still play, and a closed popup's parts stay hidden by
  the section's own visibility rules. shopify/assets/live-page-popups.js
  opens it with showModal() on the live site (the page behind is inert,
  Escape closes it) and with show() in the builder, where it is drawn in
  the page and never over it:
  - [data-pg-backdrop] the section's dimmed overlay, not drawn in the builder;
  - [data-pg-frame] a full screen box that holds the card, drawn in the flow;
  - [data-pg-card] the card itself, drawn in the flow, centred.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog] {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog]::backdrop { background: transparent; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog]:modal { pointer-events: auto; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) {
    position: relative;
    inset: auto;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) [data-pg-backdrop] { display: none !important; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) [data-pg-frame] {
    position: relative !important;
    inset: auto !important;
    width: auto !important;
    height: auto !important;
    min-height: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    overflow: visible !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    z-index: auto !important;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) [data-pg-frame]::before,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) [data-pg-frame]::after { display: none !important; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) [data-pg-card] {
    position: relative !important;
    inset: auto !important;
    left: auto !important;
    top: auto !important;
    right: auto !important;
    bottom: auto !important;
    transform: none !important;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    max-height: none !important;
    z-index: auto !important;
  }
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</style>
</template>
